      ],
      "font": "EN",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "height": 34.6,
      "text": "In 1907 the psychologist Oskar Pfungst tested the act systematically, altering one ______ after another."
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        61.0,
        524.7614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        542.0614173228347
      ],
      "font": "EN",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "height": 17.3,
      "text": "With the questioner invisible, his ______ fell to two in 35."
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        61.0,
        497.46141732283473,
        461.8976377952756,
        514.7614173228347
      ],
      "font": "EN",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "height": 17.3,
      "text": "The ______ came from the questioners."
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        61.0,
        452.8614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        487.46141732283473
      ],
      "font": "EN",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "height": 34.6,
      "text": "Every gesture and motion was ______, made unwittingly by people with no wish to deceive."
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        361.46141732283473,
        461.8976377952756,
        392.8614173228347
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "奇观  柏林一匹名叫汉斯的马用蹄子敲出算式答案；早期调查没发现作弊，表演因而被视为可信。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        323.06141732283476,
        461.8976377952756,
        354.46141732283473
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "检验  心理学家普丰斯特改变视线等条件：能看见提问者时56次对50次，看不见时35次仅对2次。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        284.6614173228348,
        461.8976377952756,
        316.06141732283476
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "机制  提问者会无意中在答案处抬头或放松；汉斯识别这些身体信号来停止敲蹄，被误以为会算术。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        246.26141732283477,
        461.8976377952756,
        277.6614173228348
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "复现  普丰斯特亲自代替汉斯，也能根据志愿者的细微动作作答，说明这种影响不限于马。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        207.86141732283477,
        461.8976377952756,
        239.26141732283477
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "防范  研究者的期待可经无意暗示影响结果，这叫聪明汉斯效应；双盲等实验设计用来减少这种偏差。"
    },
